<h2 class="g-h2" id="usage">Usage</h2>
<div class="g-prose">
  <p>Use <code>signal</code> where space is short and a label sits next to it: the sidebar's case list, the home cards' titles, the rows of a Narrow by list. Where the treatment itself is the information, use a <a href="/signals/treatment-badge/">treatment badge</a>, which names it.</p>
  <p>An index entry's worst tier comes from the <code>worstSignal</code> filter (<code>tools/filters.cjs</code>): <code>{{ "{{ signal(case.summary | worstSignal or \"Neutral\") }}" }}</code>.</p>
</div>

