<h2 class="g-h2" id="accessibility">Accessibility</h2>
<div class="g-prose"><p>The glyph is hidden from assistive technology. Where it stands for the tier, put the tier in text beside it or in a visually hidden span, as the home cards do: <code>&lt;span class="sr-only"&gt;Caution:&lt;/span&gt;</code>.</p></div>

